#!/sbin/openrc-run
# OpenRC counterpart of gts3-bdaddr.service: hci0 needs its public
# address before it is usable; gts3-bdaddr waits up to 30 s for hci_qca.
description="Set the Bluetooth address from the efs partition"

depend() {
	after bluetooth
}

start() {
	ebegin "Setting the Bluetooth address in the background"
	[ -e /dev/disk/by-partlabel/efs ] || { eend 1 "no efs partition"; return 1; }
	( /usr/sbin/gts3-bdaddr 2>&1 | logger -t gts3-bdaddr ) &
	eend 0
}
